1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,699
BRAMBLE: Case open!

2
00:00:01,699 --> 00:00:04,413
OTTO: Oh no! Which bucket is mine?

3
00:00:04,613 --> 00:00:07,474
IVY: The tags have dots, not names.

4
00:00:07,874 --> 00:00:12,103
Today's case: clapping the syllables in our names.

5
00:00:12,503 --> 00:00:15,489
OTTO: One dot! O for Otto! Mine!

6
00:00:15,889 --> 00:00:18,552
BRAMBLE: Which tag has Otto's claps?

7
00:00:18,952 --> 00:00:21,672
Clap once for each syllable.

8
00:00:22,072 --> 00:00:23,359
Ot-to.

9
00:00:24,659 --> 00:00:27,187
Two claps for Otto.

10
00:00:27,587 --> 00:00:29,727
It's B! Two dots.

11
00:00:29,927 --> 00:00:32,338
OTTO: Oh! The dots are claps!

12
00:00:32,738 --> 00:00:36,833
BRAMBLE: Let's check another way. Flip the tag.

13
00:00:37,233 --> 00:00:39,824
The back says Otto!

14
00:00:40,224 --> 00:00:41,496
BRAMBLE: Case solved!

15
00:00:41,896 --> 00:00:46,263
Say it with me. Clap once for each syllable.

16
00:00:46,663 --> 00:00:50,687
Next case: the name on a muddy sign.

